sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant G as Gateway
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant K as Knowledge Agent
    participant S as KB index
    U->>G: question + user token
    G->>G: verify token, set role, screen input
    G->>C: question + identity in session state
    C->>K: route (how-to / policy)
    K->>S: search(query, access_group filter)
    S-->>K: passages + scores
    alt best score below threshold
        K-->>U: "I could not find this. Open a ticket?"
    else relevant passages
        K->>K: write answer with [source ids]
        K->>K: validate every cited id was retrieved
        K-->>U: streamed answer with citations
    end
